or Free over £500)","white_glove_title":"Room of Choice White Glove (£49.99 or Free over £500)","surcharge_disclaimer":"Deliveries to Scottish Highlands, Isle of Man, and Northern Ireland are subject to automated regional surcharges."},"updatedAt":"Tue Oct 20 2026 19:04:05 GMT+0600 (Bangladesh Standard Time)"},"about_hero":{"id":"sec_about_hero","pageKey":"about","sectionKey":"about_hero","sectionName":"British Craftsmanship & Heritage","isEnabled":true,"sortOrder":1,"content":{"eyebrow":"Our Heritage & Philosophy","title":"Modern Living, Engineered for Everyday Comfort","story":"Founded to deliver thoughtfully designed, high-quality home furniture directly to UK doorsteps without inflated retail markups. From sturdy dining sets to modular storage chests and elegant living furniture, every piece is built for real everyday homes.","highlight_stat_1":"15,000+ Homes Furnished Across the UK","highlight_stat_2":"Rigorous Structural Durability Checks","highlight_stat_3":"100% Quality Inspected Prior to Dispatch"},"updatedAt":"Fri Oct 23 2026 10:46:20 GMT+0600 (Bangladesh Standard Time)"},"about_sustainability":{"id":"sec_about_sustainability","pageKey":"about","sectionKey":"about_sustainability","sectionName":"FSC Timber & Ethical Sourcing","isEnabled":true,"sortOrder":2,"content":{"title":"Sustainable Forestry & Responsible Materials","description":"We partner exclusively with certified sawmills across Europe and the UK that practice sustainable forestry under strict FSC and PEFC guidelines. Our foams are non-toxic, and our fabrics are free from hazardous fluorocarbons.","bullet_1":"FSC-Certified Solid European Oak & American Walnut","bullet_2":"Non-toxic high-density reflex foams","bullet_3":"Eco-conscious packaging with cardboard recycling collection"},"updatedAt":"Sun Oct 18 2026 16:39:46 GMT+0600 (Bangladesh Standard Time)"},"delivery_tiers_guide":{"id":"sec_delivery_tiers_guide","pageKey":"delivery_returns","sectionKey":"delivery_tiers_guide","sectionName":"Delivery Tiers & Service Expectations","isEnabled":true,"sortOrder":1,"content":{"title":"Specialist UK Furniture Logistics","lead_time_summary":"Mainland UK deliveries are typically completed within 7 to 14 business days. Pre-delivery booking calls are made 48 hours prior to dispatch.","tier_1_title":"1. Standard Parcel (Small Items)","tier_1_desc":"Tracked next-day courier delivery for lamps, cushions, stools, and care kits.","tier_2_title":"2. Heavy Goods Pallet Delivery","tier_2_desc":"Kerbside palletized delivery for solid wood dining tables and flatpack modular storage.","tier_3_title":"3. Two-Man White Glove Service","tier_3_desc":"Delivered into your room of choice, unpackaged, and inspected. Packaging materials are removed for recycling."},"updatedAt":"Sun Oct 18 2026 16:39:46 GMT+0600 (Bangladesh Standard Time)"},"returns_policy":{"id":"sec_returns_policy","pageKey":"delivery_returns","sectionKey":"returns_policy","sectionName":"Customer Return & Satisfaction Guide","isEnabled":true,"sortOrder":2,"content":{"title":"Customer Satisfaction & Return Guide","cooling_off_notice":"We want you to love your furniture. If you wish to return an eligible piece, please notify our customer desk.","collection_procedure":"Contact our customer support team to schedule a convenient collection.","condition_requirement":"Items must be returned in resalable condition in original protective packaging."},"updatedAt":"Fri Oct 23 2026 11:55:28 GMT+0600 (Bangladesh Standard Time)"},"contact_details":{"id":"sec_contact_details","pageKey":"contact_faq","sectionKey":"contact_details","sectionName":"Concierge Contact & Warehouse Address","isEnabled":true,"sortOrder":1,"content":{"page_title":"Customer Concierge & Support Desk","page_subtitle":"Our UK support team is available Monday through Saturday to answer questions regarding orders, product specifications, or room dimensions.","phone":"+44 (0) 20 7946 0192","email":"concierge@sanfurniture.com","whatsapp":"+44 7700 900821","hours":"Monday – Friday: 08:30 – 18:30 GMT | Saturday: 09:00 – 16:00 GMT","warehouse_address":"SAN Furniture Logistics Hub, Unit 4 Meridian Business Park, Leicester LE19 1RJ, United Kingdom"},"updatedAt":"Sun Oct 18 2026 16:39:46 GMT+0600 (Bangladesh Standard Time)"},"faq_list":{"id":"sec_faq_list","pageKey":"contact_faq","sectionKey":"faq_list","sectionName":"Frequently Asked Questions","isEnabled":true,"sortOrder":2,"content":{"faqs":[{"question":"How long does UK delivery take?","answer":"Most items are dispatched directly from our UK supplier warehouses within 3-5 business days and delivered to your doorstep within 10-15 business days. You will receive shipment tracking notifications."},{"question":"How is my furniture packaged and delivered?","answer":"Every piece is carefully boxed in reinforced flat-pack protective packaging with corner buffers, and dispatched directly across Mainland UK within 10-15 business days."},{"question":"What delivery service is provided?","answer":"We provide free delivery across Mainland UK directly to your doorstep with pre-delivery dispatch updates."},{"question":"Will I receive an itemised order receipt?","answer":"Yes, an official itemised digital order receipt with complete product codes, quantities, and order reference will be emailed upon payment confirmation."}]},"updatedAt":"Fri Oct 23 2026 10:46:20 GMT+0600 (Bangladesh Standard Time)"},"account_welcome_banner":{"id":"sec_account_welcome_banner","pageKey":"account","sectionKey":"account_welcome_banner","sectionName":"Client Portal Banner & Privileges","isEnabled":true,"sortOrder":1,"content":{"welcome_title":"SAN Client Portal","welcome_subtitle":"Manage your active furniture orders, download official VAT invoices, request swatch samples, and track white-glove dispatches.","vip_perk_badge":"UK Verified Client","support_shortcut_text":"Need urgent delivery rescheduling? Speak to dispatch directly via our live helpdesk."},"updatedAt":"Sun Oct 18 2026 16:39:46 GMT+0600 (Bangladesh Standard 